# SAFETY GUARD: this is the PUBLIC GitHub Pages repo (cladutacorp.com).
# The cold-email engine and recipient/suppression data must NEVER be committed
# here. Patterns below keep them untracked. (guard added 2026-06-09)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Email-engine / operational tooling scripts ──
claduta_drip.py
claduta_mega_blast.py
claduta_zombie_cleanup.py
process_unsubscribes.py
dump_buyer_replies.py
sheets_patch_pepper.py
fetch_prices.py
*.py

# ── Recipient lists, tracking + suppression data (PII: emails/names/phones) ──
mega_blast_tracking.csv
drip_summary.csv
suppression_unsubscribes.csv
*.csv
v11_updated.xlsx
*.xlsx
.sendgrid_suppressions.json
buyer_replies_dump.json

# ── Drip runtime state / logs ──
.drip_state.json
.drip.lock
.pepper_patch_state.json
.unsubscribe_scanner_last_ok
logs/
mega_blast_cron.log
mega_blast_log.txt
pepper_blast_log_*.txt

# ── Backups (never commit data backups) ──
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.before_fix

# ── Secrets / keys (defensive — should already live outside the repo) ──
.secrets/
*.env
api.env
*.key
*.pem
*-key.json
*credentials*.json

# ── Local memory drafts / auth notes / one-off reports ──
MEMORY.md.work
MEMORY.md.bak
SHEETS_AUTH_NOTES.md
overnight_report_*.md
personal_outbox_*.md

# ── Python build artifacts ──
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
